// Parsea gli eventi iCal di Moodle e prepara i task/eventi unici non ancora presenti su Notion
const icalRaw = $('Fetch Unizar Moodle iCal Feed').first().json.data || '';
const icalText = typeof icalRaw === 'string' ? icalRaw : JSON.stringify(icalRaw);

const existingTasksRaw = $('Query Notion Tasks for Deduplication').first().json.results || [];
const existingRefs = new Set();
const existingTitles = new Set();

for (const t of existingTasksRaw) {
  const ref = t.properties['Source Ref']?.rich_text[0]?.plain_text || '';
  const title = (t.properties['Task Name']?.title[0]?.plain_text || '').toLowerCase().trim();
  if (ref) existingRefs.add(ref);
  if (title) existingTitles.add(title);
}

const courseMap = {
  '30232': 'Algoritmia',
  '30227': 'Sistemas Operativos',
  '30211': 'Redes de computadores',
  'rc': 'Redes de computadores',
  'web engineering': 'Web Engineering',
  '30246': 'Web Engineering',
  '30239': 'Diseño de redes',
  '30223': 'Inteligencia Artificial'
};

function resolveCourse(cat) {
  const low = (cat || '').toLowerCase();
  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(courseMap)) {
    if (low.includes(k)) return v;
  }
  return cat ? cat.slice(0, 30) : 'Università';
}

function parseIcalDate(raw) {
  if (!raw || raw.length < 8) return null;
  const clean = raw.trim();
  const y = clean.slice(0, 4);
  const m = clean.slice(4, 6);
  const d = clean.slice(6, 8);
  if (clean.includes('T')) {
    const timePart = clean.split('T')[1].replace('Z', '');
    const hh = timePart.slice(0, 2);
    const mm = timePart.slice(2, 4);
    const ss = timePart.slice(4, 6) || '00';
    return `${y}-${m}-${d}T${hh}:${mm}:${ss}Z`;
  }
  return `${y}-${m}-${d}`;
}

const eventBlocks = icalText.split('BEGIN:VEVENT');
const newTasks = [];
const seenSlots = new Set();

for (let i = 1; i < eventBlocks.length; i++) {
  const block = eventBlocks[i].split('END:VEVENT')[0];
  const summaryMatch = block.match(/SUMMARY:(.*?)(?:\r?\n)/);
  const dtstartMatch = block.match(/DTSTART:(.*?)(?:\r?\n)/);
  const uidMatch = block.match(/UID:(.*?)(?:\r?\n)/);
  const catMatch = block.match(/CATEGORIES:(.*?)(?:\r?\n)/);
  const descMatch = block.match(/DESCRIPTION:([\s\S]*?)(?:CLASS|LAST-MODIFIED|CATEGORIES|$)/);

  const title = summaryMatch ? summaryMatch[1].trim() : 'Evento Universitario';
  const rawStart = dtstartMatch ? dtstartMatch[1].trim() : '';
  const uid = uidMatch ? uidMatch[1].trim() : `moodle_${Date.now()}_${i}`;
  const cat = catMatch ? catMatch[1].trim() : '';
  const desc = (descMatch ? descMatch[1] : '').replace(/\\n/g, ' ').trim();

  const course = resolveCourse(cat);
  const startISO = parseIcalDate(rawStart);
  const dateStr = startISO ? startISO.slice(0, 10) : new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);

  // Deduplica slot generico 'Submission is due' se esiste già un titolo specifico per la stessa data e corso
  const slotKey = `${course}_${dateStr}`;
  if (title.toLowerCase() === 'submission is due' && seenSlots.has(slotKey)) {
    continue;
  }
  seenSlots.add(slotKey);

  const cleanTitle = `[${course}] ${title}`;

  // Verifica se già presente su Notion
  if (existingRefs.has(uid) || existingTitles.has(cleanTitle.toLowerCase())) {
    continue;
  }

  newTasks.push({
    title: cleanTitle,
    course: course,
    date: dateStr,
    startISO: startISO,
    uid: uid,
    desc: desc
  });
}

return newTasks.map(t => ({ json: t }));

